[01:10.74] Who are they
[01:13.70] Who are a threat to our beliefs
[01:24.52] So we descend in our mistrust
[01:30.16] Like vengeful wolves
[01:37.60] Bitter daylight
[01:41.52] Hangs above us with the rain
[01:49.08] What is this that tells you
[01:56.50] I am right or wrong
[02:14.16] I'm not saying...
